  "direction": "TB",
  "nodeMaxEm": 26,
  "section": "2.1",
  "nodes": [
    {
      "id": "s1",
      "label": "① 装饰 @tilelang.jit",
      "sub": "jit/__init__.py:588 → JITImpl（只是包装，不编译）",
      "tone": "default"
    },
    {
      "id": "s2",
      "label": "② 取 TIR  JITImpl.get_tir",
      "sub": "jit/__init__.py:379 → PrimFunc（eager 走 Builder 追踪）",
      "tone": "default"
    },
    {
      "id": "s3",
      "label": "③ 缓存查询 JITImpl.__call__",
      "sub": "jit/__init__.py:519 · _kernel_cache / cached()",
      "tone": "accent"
    },
    {
      "id": "s4",
      "label": "④ lower  lower_with_context",
      "sub": "engine/lower.py:144 → host_mod + device_mod",
      "tone": "default"
    },
    {
      "id": "s5",
      "label": "⑤ codegen  device_codegen / host_codegen",
      "sub": "engine/lower.py:99 / :104 / :65",
      "tone": "default"
    },
    {
      "id": "s6",
      "label": "⑥ adapter  _create_adapter_from_artifact",
      "sub": "jit/kernel.py:324 → tvm_ffi / cython / nvrtc / torch / cutedsl",
      "tone": "accent"
    },
    {
      "id": "s7",
      "label": "⑦ 可调用 kernel(a, b) → 结果张量",
      "sub": "JITKernel.torch_function :149 · __call__ :206",
      "tone": "accent"
    }
  ],
  "edges": [
    { "from": "s1", "to": "s2" },
    { "from": "s2", "to": "s3", "label": "先取 TIR 再算 key" },
    { "from": "s3", "to": "s4", "label": "未命中" },
    { "from": "s4", "to": "s5" },
    { "from": "s5", "to": "s6" },
    { "from": "s6", "to": "s7" }
  ],
  "groups": [{ "label": "缓存命中时 ④⑤⑥ 全部跳过", "nodes": ["s4", "s5", "s6"], "tone": "muted" }],
  "notes": [
    "装饰阶段不编译：只把函数包成 JITImpl，顺手记下源码文本与签名。",
    "②→③ 的顺序不能颠倒：lower 需要 PrimFunc，而缓存 key 建立在 func.script() 上。",
    "⑦ 只有一个出口：不管后端是哪一个，对外都是 adapter.func。"
  ]
